  "title": "Beef Peach Pie",
  "description": "A meatloaf with a twist. The peaches add a sweet touch and go well with the ground beef.",
  "authors": [
    "Diana Webb"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-03-04T23:57:46-05:00",
